<zk>
	<daterangebox id="drb" format="yyyy-MM-dd" width="360px"/>
	<textbox id="tb"/>
	<label multiline="true" style="position: absolute; left: 10px; top: 420px">
		WCAG 2.5.2 (za11y): open the calendar, then press and hold on an empty part of the page —
		the popup must stay open until you release. Moving back onto the popup or the box before
		releasing keeps it open. Pressing on the textbox closes it only on release too.
	</label>
</zk>
